			"notes": "Internal code quality and stability improvements. Now with Minecraft 1.20.1 support!\n\n###  New\n- Added support for Minecraft 1.20.1\n\n###  Improvements\n- Improved exception handling across packet handlers errors are now properly logged instead of silently swallowed\n- Fixed malformed `versionRange` in `mods.toml` resolves potential compatibility issues on mod loading\n- Unified HUD anchor defaults between server and client no more temporary inconsistency on join\n- Fixed typo in client command (`/hudmutedsz`)\n- Removed unused textures and assets from the packaged mod\n- Fixed the update Checker"
		},
