			"notes": "Version 1.1.5 brings critical stability fixes and security improvements to BetterMChats.\n\nBug Fixes\n\n* Fixed server freeze on login — Update checker now runs async instead of blocking the main thread\n* Fixed HUD anchor not working — HUD now correctly repositions based on your configured anchor\n* Fixed `/me` packet overflow — Added length validation before sending action messages\n* Fixed `/me` spam — `/me` now has the same cooldown as other chat channels"
		},
